// Forest: a clearing in a deep forest with a brook, through the seasons, rain and snow, wind and
// the time of day, set with the sliders of the panel (H hides it). Fly with the camera controller.
//
// The forest library (forest/library) brings the state the sliders write, the wind, the
// materials, the bark, leaves and trees, the undergrowth, the boulders, the sky and light and the
// HUD. This scene adds one file per concern in forest/: the layout functions that place things,
// the floor, the ground, the brook, the stands the trees grow in, the undergrowth scattered on
// the floor, what falls from the trees in the wind, the air (light shafts, mist over the brook
// and motes), the insects, the view, the rain, sleet or snow that falls around the camera, the
// sound of the wind, the brook, the rain, the birds and the crickets, and the animals.
include ui/widgets
include trees/generator
include forest/library
include forest/layout
include forest/floor
include forest/ground
include forest/brook
include forest/stands
include forest/scatter
include forest/fall
include forest/atmosphere
include forest/insects
include forest/view
include forest/precipitation
include forest/audio
include forest/animals

using box.view

$ {
  box.app.FpsTarget: {60}
  Scene: {
    reflections: true,
    environment: true,
    aerial_perspective: true,
    cookies: true,
    alpha_cutout: true,
    blend_modes: true,
    texture_blend: true,
    texture_layers: true,
    triplanar: true,
    diffuse_transmission: true,
    texture_scroll: true,
    water: true,
    planar_reflections: true,
    wind: true
  }
}
